                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c015af95-ee95-3c83-bc24-2f1b1ff3644b",
                        "entry_id": "652a1e65-bc7c-3156-ba8d-78e7c3b48a47",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The act of voting, especially when not to elect a government or head of state."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "rare",
                            "uncountable",
                            "usually"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "84e1ca15-77d7-486d-8b05-7e83bea0d601",
                                "sense_id": "c015af95-ee95-3c83-bc24-2f1b1ff3644b",
                                "text": "Yet there is some reluctance to do this partly because coming to decisions, even the simple yes/no of a votation, can prove difficult."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "af9c2d50-0c5b-4b39-9e5e-ab5fb5de9d07",
                                "sense_id": "c015af95-ee95-3c83-bc24-2f1b1ff3644b",
                                "text": "The first votation would establish whether the Jurassian people did indeed wish to create their own canton, but given the internal division of the Jura people between separatists and loyalists, no district or commune would be forced to stay with the old canton or go with the new one against its own will."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d218dc06-5d9c-483f-85ac-6c6e171a4572",
                                "sense_id": "c015af95-ee95-3c83-bc24-2f1b1ff3644b",
                                "text": "Nonetheless, the failure to resolve the problems created by the 9 February forced people, and cantons, to consider a new votation."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "e1a94ba5-a624-3049-b98d-6e7c3b13f032",
